        "original_id": "cfc6528e-df66-5b0d-8102-80efa6e291c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donna Freedman, Margot Robbie, Ringo Brown\n- Works: Neighbours\n- Roles: fictional character, actor\n- Topics: casting, award nominations, storylines\n\nFacts:\n- Donna Freedman, also known as Donna Brown, is a fictional character from the Australian soap opera Neighbours.\n- Margot Robbie played Donna Freedman in Neighbours.\n- Margot Robbie was later cast in Neighbours and appeared in the soap opera from 2008 to 2011.\n- Margot Robbie's work on Neighbours earned her two Logie Award nominations.\n- Ringo Brown is a character whose Neighbours storylines included an ongoing battle with an eating disorder.\n- Ringo Brown's Neighbours storylines included a bus crash, a relationship with an older woman, and the collapse of a warehouse roof at an illegal dance party.\n- Ringo Brown's Neighbours storylines included an on-off relationship with Donna Freedman.",
